  "ingredients": [
    "4 (6 ounce) chicken breast halves",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon red pepper flakes",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon onion powder",
    "3 tablespoons low-sodium soy sauce",
    "2 tablespoons sesame oil",
    "2 teaspoons honey",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UacHkBlt3aJbkfNjH2ZEqlHc7No=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269366-simple-sauteed-sesame-chicken-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-1342-6c8f50ce0d6f433fb9494b9ebc5c9298.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269366/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut chicken breasts into 1/4-inch thick slices; cut slices to 1 1/2 inches in length. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MEoNzvHbnc9xetaL5APhIsQshM4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269366-simple-sauteed-sesame-chicken-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-1345-094ca5e96e28483f9d377ab19f0fe49b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269366/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, red pepper flakes, garlic powder, and onion powder in a large bowl. Add chicken and toss until well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fz3yggXIKxZePm-eob8SLgOg2CI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269366-simple-sauteed-sesame-chicken-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-1346-ddacb82d97cf451da97719e726345113.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269366/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add soy sauce, sesame oil, and honey; stir to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nmiEg9BQ9OQo80uZv_kUT6pMxGo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269366-simple-sauteed-sesame-chicken-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-1347-8c72842553e845b3bb04568302c1dbaf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269366/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add chicken and sauté until golden brown and the juices run clear, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
